다음과 같이 신청서를 제출해주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1. 신청실수:&nbsp; 10평형 1실</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2. 신청기간:&nbsp; 2023</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">. 8. 7.(월)&nbsp;~8. 11.(금)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">입&nbsp; 주&nbsp; 일:&nbsp; 2023. 8.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">10.(목)&nbsp;~8. 25.(금)</span><font color=\"#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(70, 115, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(70, 115, 255);\">※&nbsp; 입주기간 내에서 입주일 협의&nbsp;</span></b></span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">4. 신청대상:&nbsp; 금오공과대학교 재학(재직) 중인 대학원생,&nbsp; 박사후과정(포닥) 연구원,&nbsp; 연구교수,</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 시간강사,&nbsp; 연구관련 종사 교직원,&nbsp; 교직원 등</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">5. 신청방법:&nbsp; 메일신청(kit_dorm4@kumoh.ac.kr, 478-7944)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">6. 신청서류:&nbsp; 입주신청서, 개인정보동의서,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">연구관련 종사자 연구관련 증빙서류(자율서식)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">7.&nbsp; 기타 자세한 사항은 붙임 파일 참조</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">8. 문의전화:&nbsp; 054)478-7944</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
